@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<head>
    <link href="~/css/Privacy.css" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>

<div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
    <h1 class="text-center text-primary mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
        At <strong>PropEase</strong>, we value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information.
        This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your data when you use our website and services.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4 text-primary">1. Information We Collect</h4>
    <p>We may collect the following types of information:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Personal Details:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, and contact preferences when you register or contact us.</li>
        <li><strong>Property Information:</strong> Details you submit when listing properties, such as images, pricing, and descriptions.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Information about your device, IP address, browser type, and how you interact with our site.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4 class="mt-4 text-primary">2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
    <p>We use your data to:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Provide, manage, and improve our property listing services.</li>
        <li>Respond to your inquiries or support requests.</li>
        <li>Send updates, notifications, or promotional information (only with your consent).</li>
        <li>Ensure compliance with legal and regulatory requirements.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4 class="mt-4 text-primary">3. Data Protection</h4>
    <p>
        We adopt industry-standard security practices to protect your data against unauthorized access, disclosure,
        alteration, or destruction. Your information is stored securely and only accessible to authorized personnel.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4 text-primary">4. Sharing Your Information</h4>
    <p>
        We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or trade your personal information.
        We may share data only with trusted partners who assist in website operation, email delivery, or analytics—under strict confidentiality agreements.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4 text-primary">5. Cookies</h4>
    <p>
        PropEase uses cookies to enhance your browsing experience, remember your preferences, and improve site performance.
        You can disable cookies in your browser settings, but some features may not function properly.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4 text-primary">6. Your Rights</h4>
    <p>
        You have the right to access, update, or delete your personal information.
        To exercise these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@propease.com">support@propease.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4 text-primary">7. Updates to This Policy</h4>
    <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements.
        Please review this page periodically for the latest version.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4 text-primary">8. Contact Us</h4>
    <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled,
        please contact us at:
    </p>
    <address>
        <strong>PropEase Support Team</strong><br />
        📧 Email: <a href="mailto:support@propease.com">support@propease.com</a><br />
        🌐 Website: <a href="/">www.propease.com</a>
    </address>

    <hr class="mt-5" />
    <p class="text-center text-muted small">© @DateTime.Now.Year PropEase. All rights reserved.</p>
</div>
